WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.344 --> 00:00:15.568
Tina: Thanks for coming this far with us, Hopian.

2
00:00:15.608 --> 00:00:18.408
Hopian: The rest is up to you two.

3
00:00:19.129 --> 00:00:19.809
Good luck.

4
00:00:19.829 --> 00:00:22.730
Tina: Will I see you again?

5
00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:25.190
Hopian: You never know.

6
00:00:26.211 --> 00:00:28.791
The future is impossible to predict.

7
00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:34.260
Tina: I'll miss you.

8
00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:37.963
Hopian: I'll miss you too.

9
00:00:39.264 --> 00:00:41.446
Don't stay away too long, Bello.

10
00:00:41.466 --> 00:00:47.970
Hopian: Remember, time will flow faster for me while you're away.

11
00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:51.853
Bye. Bello: I'll see you soon, Dad.

12
00:00:51.893 --> 00:00:57.717
Tina: The mountain looks easier to climb now.

13
00:00:57.737 --> 00:00:59.638
Bello: Yes.

14
00:00:59.939 --> 00:01:01.620
We visit here all the time.

15
00:01:02.572 --> 00:01:04.093
The mountain is now a park.

16
00:01:05.074 --> 00:01:06.816
Tina: It looks like a long walk.

17
00:01:07.936 --> 00:01:10.098
Bello: Well, it's still a tall mountain.

18
00:01:10.739 --> 00:01:11.800
That hasn't changed.

19
00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:14.582
Tina: I guess we should get started.

20
00:01:14.602 --> 00:01:16.584
Bello: Here, let me help.

21
00:01:27.032 --> 00:01:29.274
Look. It's the vine Danny planted.

22
00:01:29.294 --> 00:01:31.596
Bello: Wait until you see the top.

23
00:01:35.552 --> 00:01:36.313
Look over there.

24
00:01:36.333 --> 00:01:38.094
Tina: Wow.

25
00:01:38.474 --> 00:01:41.176
That vine has really grown in fifteen years!

26
00:01:42.517 --> 00:01:43.978
Tina: Hey, there's the rainbow.

27
00:01:44.759 --> 00:01:46.080
It looks so close.

28
00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:48.982
Bello: Yes, but it's high in the sky.

29
00:01:49.002 --> 00:01:52.364
Tina: How will we get to it?

30
00:01:52.384 --> 00:01:55.346
Bello: We'll have to figure something out.

31
00:01:58.929 --> 00:02:01.270
Hmm I think it could work.

32
00:02:01.991 --> 00:02:03.492
Tina: What are you thinking?

33
00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:08.862
Bello: Tina, go stand at the other end of the park.

34
00:02:10.423 --> 00:02:13.185
Tina: Okay.

35
00:02:13.225 --> 00:02:13.605
Now what?

36
00:02:13.625 --> 00:02:16.447
Bello: You said you were a good runner, Tina.

37
00:02:16.467 --> 00:02:18.248
Tina: That's right.

38
00:02:18.268 --> 00:02:19.549
Bello: Good.

39
00:02:20.009 --> 00:02:21.851
Run as fast as you can toward me.

40
00:02:29.676 --> 00:02:31.857
Tina: It worked!

41
00:02:32.238 --> 00:02:32.658
It worked!

42
00:02:32.678 --> 00:02:35.180
Bello: Great job, Tina.

43
00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:38.089
Tina: But how will you get up here?

44
00:02:49.656 --> 00:02:51.097
Now, tie it tight.

45
00:02:54.058 --> 00:02:58.181
Tina: You did it!

46
00:02:58.201 --> 00:03:00.402
Bello: It wasn't that hard.

47
00:03:01.022 --> 00:03:03.304
I used to climb on those vines when I was a kid.

48
00:03:04.216 --> 00:03:05.657
Tina: It's time to slide!

49
00:03:06.017 --> 00:03:06.677
Let's go!

50
00:03:15.301 --> 00:03:16.121
Where are we?

51
00:03:16.141 --> 00:03:18.102
Tina: This is perfect!

52
00:03:18.722 --> 00:03:20.323
We are right beside my house!

53
00:03:21.003 --> 00:03:24.245
Bello: Who's that?

54
00:03:24.265 --> 00:03:27.046
Tina: Um, that's my neighbor, Mrs.

55
00:03:27.166 --> 00:03:32.108
Rice. Bello: She's waving at me!

56
00:03:33.816 --> 00:03:35.657
Tina: I don't think she's waving.

57
00:03:42.581 --> 00:03:44.523
I don't think she is happy to see me.

58
00:03:44.543 --> 00:03:46.544
Tina: Uh-oh.
